Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴利舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一艘非联盟飞船径直从白太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A non-federation vessel jumped straight out of white space
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳到我们前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是瓦尔达克  - 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Valdack. - That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的扫描数据显示是一艘重装甲戈尔甘无畏战舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My data scan indicates a heavily armored Gorgan Dreadnought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,序列号是9864321\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vessel ID number 9864321.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  杜达尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Dudani.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦尔达克肯定是从费尔密中心劫持了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valdack must have hijacked it from the Fermi hub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪到了我们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tracked our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,图拉斯卡  防护罩状态如何 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulaska, shield status?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防护罩完好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:00:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 帕克舵手  - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Helmsman Packer? - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备启动后推进器  - 后推进器已启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prime rear thrusters. - Rear thrusters primed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那瓦尔达克  他会把我们撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's Valdack, he'll rip us to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长  我们必须得投降  别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we have to surrender. There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别自乱阵脚  沃顿中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not lose our heads, Lieutenant Walton.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.29,0:01:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防护罩只剩68%了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields at 68%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现严重损伤  六号至十号船舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy damage reported, decks six through ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医疗中心着火  货仓α出现大裂口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fires in med center and major rupture to cargo bay Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有别的选择了  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got no choice, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我联系瓦尔达克的飞船吗  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want me to open comms with Valdack's craft, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 防护罩还剩54%  - 我们走投无路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shields at 54%. - There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 舰长  求你了  - 不是时候  沃顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain, please. - Not now, Walton.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.97,0:01:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舵手帕克  飞进小行星气体团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helmsman Packer, take us into that asteroid gas cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 飞进气体团  - 那就是自杀  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Into the cluster? - That's suicide, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气团中充满了电离派朗粒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That gas cluster is charged with ionized pyron particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们的防护罩撑得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our shields hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就能利用这些粒子增加我们的光子强度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can use them to increase our photon intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克  加大推进器火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packer, increase thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防护罩还剩43%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields at 43%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船会四分五裂的  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll tear the ship apart, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃顿  你是一名太空舰队长官  拿出点样子来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walton, you are a Space Fleet officer. Act accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 防护罩仅剩32%  - 瓦尔达克没跟上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shields at 32%. - Valdack's not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克  调头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Packer, turn us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,图拉斯卡  光子闪电炮准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulaska, charge photon bolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备完毕  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolts charged, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的外壳破损了  防护罩已消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His hull's breached, shields gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他失去了防护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛瑞中尉  打开通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Lowry, open comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他主动联系我们了  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's already hailing us, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴利舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Daly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.91,0:02:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你溺死在900条塔格瑞安毒蛇的毒液中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may you drown in the venom of 900 Tragorian snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被我打败了  瓦尔达克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are defeated, Valdack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把等离子团水晶还回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return the plasmorthian crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就停止对你的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll cause you no more damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我是个白痴吧  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must think me a fool, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道水晶的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the crystal's capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死不放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will die before I give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给了你机会  瓦尔达克  手下留情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you a chance, Valdack, showed you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁你还活着知道点好歹吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reflect on that while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关闭通讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 图拉斯卡  摧毁他的飞船  - 是  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tulaska, destroy his ship. - Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太了不起了  舰长  - 你救了我们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was incredible, Captain. - You saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我先前失控了  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I lost it back there, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是第一次了  沃顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for the first time, Walton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在该知道了  永远不要怀疑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I should know by now never to doubt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍息  沃顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease, Walton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长  传感器感应到在瓦尔达克的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, sensors indicate an escape pod ejected
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸前有一艘逃生舱弹出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Valdack's ship before detonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带着水晶逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's escaping with the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我设定追击航线吗  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to plot a pursuit course, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时  让他跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll let him go... for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个伟大的决定  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great decision-making, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为戴利舰长欢呼三声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three cheers for Captain Daly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿嘿  - 万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hip hip. - Hooray!
