Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要知道这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's all you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.27,0:25:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个噩梦  绝对是噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a dream. Yeah, it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:26:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更像是一个永远醒不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more like an eternal waking nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.83,0:26:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法逃离的噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from which there is no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不不  - 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no. No, no, no. No, no, no. - Oh, for fuck's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想让她慢慢接受呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to break her in gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.80,0:26:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她越早接受越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The quicker she gets it, the easier it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.59,0:26:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.39,0:26:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他马上就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be here any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得留在舰桥上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta stay on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他控制着一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He controls everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.30,0:26:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他会不择手段让我们服从  - 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He does shit to make us cooperate. - Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.13,0:26:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你根本不知道  我是想帮你  - 别管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have no idea. I'm trying to help. - Just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.08,0:26:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是不守规矩  他会让我们都不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna fuck us up if she doesn't play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.98,0:26:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她必须自己认识到这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, she's gonna have to work it out for herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.05,0:26:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like we all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.01,0:26:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有出口  开门啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gotta be a way out. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔中尉  欢迎上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Cole, welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.55,0:27:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船员们  我们来了一位新成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crew, we have a new member of the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.39,0:27:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科技官娜内特·科尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science Officer Nanette Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.09,0:27:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, take your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.91,0:27:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信我们终于追踪到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe we've finally managed to
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.63,0:27:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓦尔达克在一颗无名星球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}track Valdack to an uncharted planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.35,0:27:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 就位  这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Take your post. That is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.93,0:27:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.32,0:27:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你融入进来  会好受得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole thing's much better if you let yourself get into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.68,0:27:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会配合你的《太空原力》幻想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I'm playing along with your Space Force bullshit...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.26,0:27:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 《太空舰队》  - 随便了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Space Fleet. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别妄想了  - 这是我的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can think again. - This is my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.67,0:27:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是你的舰长  命令就是命令  - 那就滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am your captain. An order is an order. - Then go fuck yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.69,0:27:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  那我们就这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. So we're doing it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.55,0:27:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要发射火球吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna throw a fireball?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  你看不到  你无法呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear. You can't see. You can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.88,0:28:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不爽吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unpleasant, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.93,0:28:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你服从吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you submit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.61,0:28:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't die, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.99,0:28:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里没人能死  除非我允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one dies in here unless I want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.28,0:28:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我想  我可以让你一辈子都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can keep you like this forever if I feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.32,0:28:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一辈子通过不存在的嘴喘不过气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forever gasping for breath with a mouth that isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意服从吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you submit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是好姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.15,0:28:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔中尉  查找瓦尔达克的藏身点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Cole, Valdack's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请三角定位信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Triangulate the signal, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.84,0:29:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便摁哪个按钮  都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's any button. They're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.36,0:29:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到了一个5级行星的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting a signal from a class five planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.44,0:29:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 兰诺池  - 兰诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rannotch. - Rannoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.65,0:29:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰诺克B星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rannoch B.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  杜达尼  准备传送系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. Dudani, prepare the transmat system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.77,0:29:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.33,0:29:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃顿  帕克  洛瑞  跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walton, Packer, Lowry, with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.72,0:29:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去那个星球  拿回水晶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll transport down to the planet, reclaim the crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.87,0:29:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把瓦尔达克绳之以法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bring Valdack to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧  科尔  你也来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Cole, you come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对你是个绝佳的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect opportunity for you to
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.32,0:29:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来证明你不是只有太空舰队的推荐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prove you're more than a recommendation from Space Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.69,0:30:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杜达尼先生  传送  - 是  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Dudani, transport. - Aye aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.27,0:30:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气可呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathable atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫描探测等离子团痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning for plasmorthian traces.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水晶在这个方向  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crystal's this way. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.33,0:30:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 内特  - 叫我帕克舵手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nate. Hey, Nate. - Helmsman Packer, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.43,0:30:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得叫我帕克舵手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta call me Helmsman Packer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.06,0:30:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他讨厌我们不用头衔称呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hates it when we don't use our proper titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.40,0:30:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了  你有枪  我们把他干掉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. You got a gun, so let's take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.71,0:30:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.06,0:30:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了  一  我们的枪根本不能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, one, our guns don't even work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.39,0:30:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他的能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only his does.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.27,0:30:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二  我们没法干掉那混蛋  明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two, the motherfucker is invincible, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.15,0:30:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.07,0:30:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你还有把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you've got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.44,0:30:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.76,0:30:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又见面了  戴利舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We meet again, Captain Daly!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.24,0:31:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.50,0:31:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不建议你这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not advisable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.15,0:31:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的等离子手雷能把你们打成尖叫的肉泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My plasma grenade will turn you into screaming soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会杀我们的  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not going to kill us, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.47,0:31:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有出其不意的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had the element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.71,0:31:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要杀我们的话早就下手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd have done it when he had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没弄明白怎么用水晶吧  瓦尔达克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't worked out how to use the crystal, have you, Valdack?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.46,0:31:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确实需要你的太空舰队知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true I require your Space Fleet knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.94,0:31:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你也确实必须告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's also true that you're gonna give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.82,0:31:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.06,0:31:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.60,0:31:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你们一个一个被我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how your resolve holds up
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.86,0:31:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霸王甲虫吞掉后  看你是不是还这么嘴硬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once you're devoured one by one by my Arachnajax!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.73,0:31:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去  我的天  - 我们要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy shit. Oh, my God. - We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.45,0:31:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我们并不能让你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing us won't make us tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水晶怎么用  瓦尔达克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how the crystal works, Valdack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.18,0:32:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will never...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.99,0:32:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  好像是我的匹萨到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. I think my pizza's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏暂停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pause game.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.99,0:32:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到他说的了  他暂停了游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him. He paused the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.37,0:32:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的匹萨到了... 在现实世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause he's got a pizza delivery... out there.
